This directory contains all of the files needed to run both the MLPs and CNNs however thier execution differes substancialy.
Some things to note is taht while not required these programs do work better with a cuda enabled gpu. If not present
it will default to using the cpu.

For running mlps:
Enter the main.py file and comment/uncomment the models and different functionalities that you would like to run.
Simply run the file from main.py and the program will load and train the desired model.

For Running CNNs:
use the CNN.ipynb book to run it. Go to the final section of the book and this is where you can enable/disable settigns as desired
from there you can simply run all of the cells and the program will do the rest
